The platform logos used to label an item's capture source (Douyin, Bilibili,
Xiaohongshu, YouTube, V2EX) come from Simple Icons, with the path data
inlined in apps/desktop/src/renderer/components/ui/PlatformLogos.tsx and
docs/images/readme-platforms.svg. The icon data is released under CC0-1.0,
but the trademarks remain the property of their respective owners and are
used here solely to identify the source of a captured item, implying no
affiliation or endorsement. The NGA, LINUX DO and Appinn glyphs are original
marks because Simple Icons has no matching entries; 2Libra uses the balance
glyph from its public site favicon. They are used for the same referential
purpose and imply no affiliation or endorsement.

